"""
Certified Reasoning Architecture v2.1 – final production version
================================================================
Multi-axis hallucination detection with additive integrity scoring and
per-trace local suspicion, backed by 2025‑2026 literature.

Axes:
  1. TDA (persistence homology – H0/H1 lifetime, entropy, spread, width)
  2. Geometric kinematics (cumulative displacement × Menger curvature)
  3. Cross‑trace coherence (Smith‑Waterman alignment of step sequences)
  4. Graph‑theoretic features (top‑5 discriminative properties)
  5. Semantic energy (average log‑probability → calibrated confidence)
  6. Multi‑dimensional step verification (numeric, logic, data, restatement, format)

Aggregation: additive weighted sum → causal‑depth penalty → per‑trace local
suspicion multiplier → dynamic‑temperature softmax voting.
"""

 

